# What Railway must not receive.
#
# The agent is built on Railway from source, so every build artefact here is
# both useless to it and actively harmful: an uploaded `.output` makes
# `eve build` try to rename a directory across a device boundary inside the
# builder, which fails with EXDEV and takes the whole build down after it has
# otherwise succeeded. That is how this file came to exist.
.output
.eve
node_modules
.git
